        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 9.07 The parties agree to participate in a Labor-Management Cooperation Fund, under authority of Section 6(b) of the Labor Management Cooperation Act of 1978, 29 U.S.C. §175(a) and Section 302(c)(9) of the Labor Management Relations Act, 29 U.S.C. §186(c)(9). The purposes of this Fund include the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                121,
                325,
                1042,
                487
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    121.0,
                    325.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    325.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    487.0
                ],
                [
                    121.0,
                    487.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) to improve communications between representatives of Labor and Management;",
            "block_bbox": [
                120,
                489,
                1083,
                544
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    120.0,
                    489.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    489.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    544.0
                ],
                [
                    120.0,
                    544.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) to provide workers and employers with opportunities to study and explore new and innovative joint approaches to achieving organizational effectiveness;",
            "block_bbox": [
                119,
                569,
                1069,
                654
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    119.0,
                    569.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    569.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    654.0
                ],
                [
                    119.0,
                    654.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) to assist workers and employers in solving problems of mutual concern not susceptible to resolution within the collective bargaining process;",
            "block_bbox": [
                119,
                678,
                1071,
                763
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    119.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1071.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1071.0,
                    763.0
                ],
                [
                    119.0,
                    763.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) to study and explore ways of eliminating potential problems which reduce the competitiveness and inhibit the economic development of the electrical construction industry;",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                788,
                1087,
                872
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    116.44835662841797,
                    794.6139526367188
                ],
                [
                    1085.939453125,
                    787.6104125976562
                ],
                [
                    1086.4912109375,
                    863.9965209960938
                ],
                [
                    117.00011444091797,
                    871.0000610351562
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) to sponsor programs which improve job security, enhance economic and community development, and promote the general welfare of the community and industry;",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                897,
                1007,
                981
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    897.0
                ],
